{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2022-08-23 11:00:00', 'title': 'MONUMENTAL SPORTS & ENTERTAINMENT TO ACQUIRE FULL OWNERSHIP OF NBC SPORTS WASHINGTON', 'text': 'MSE TO PURCHASE NBCUNIVERSAL\'S 67% STAKE IN THE REGIONAL SPORTS NETWORK THAT HOLDS EXCLUSIVE LOCAL TELEVISION RIGHTS FOR MSE\'S TEAMS: THE NHL\'S WASHINGTON CAPITALS AND NBA\'S WASHINGTON WIZARDS\xa0 WASHINGTON , AUG. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MONUMENTAL SPORTS & ENTERTAINMENT ("MSE") AND COMCAST CORPORATION TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT UNDER WHICH MSE WILL\xa0ACQUIRE 100% OF THE EQUITY\xa0INTERESTS IN NBC SPORTS WASHINGTON BY ACQUIRING NBCUNIVERSAL\'S 67%\xa0STAKE IN THE NETWORK. MSE CURRENTLY OWNS 33% OF NBC SPORTS WASHINGTON, WHICH IT ACQUIRED IN 2016.'}